# PlayArena Frontend Environment Configuration

# Local development:
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api/v1

# Production Deployment (Vercel Project Settings):
# Must be set to the full deployed backend URL ending with /api/v1 (e.g. https://your-backend.onrender.com/api/v1).
# IMPORTANT: After configuring or updating this variable in the Vercel dashboard (Settings -> Environment Variables),
# you MUST trigger a redeployment (Deployments -> Redeploy), because Vite statically inlines VITE_* environment
# variables into the client JavaScript bundle at build time.
